<%- include('partials/header') %>

<title><%= title %></title>

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <%- include('partials/pagetitle') %>
    <!--style sheet is for full-size monitor-->
    <link href="/Content/full.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" 
    media="only screen and (min-width:960px)">
    <!--style sheet is for tablet-->
    <link href="/Content/tablets.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css"
    media="only screen and (min-width:481px) and (max-width:959px)">
    <!--style sheet is for smart phone-->
    <link href="/Content/smartphones.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css"
    media="only screen and (max-width:480px)">
</head>

<h1 id="abouth">Introduction</h1>
<p id="aboutp">
    Hi, my name is Justin Chan and I am a 3rd year Networking and IT Security Student.
    I switched to this program from Computer Science because I found Networking more interesting.
    I am from Markham and my background is mainly Chinese and Filipino.
    There were some Web Development courses that I took during my time in Computer Science, so I have some previous
    knowledge about the Web and Script Programming course from the past.
</p>
<h1 id="abouth">Introduction Image</h1>
<img src="/Assets/images/me.png" alt="Personal Image">
